  "description": "Lightweight, self-hosted APM for ASP.NET Core web applications. Monitor exceptions, request latency, slow SQL queries, system health and outbound HTTP calls with a built-in live dashboard. No cloud account, no agents, no infrastructure. Drop in with two lines of code. Designed for IIS and Windows on-premises deployments across production and lower environments, and local development.",
